# Open Air 😈🔥

Open Air is an AI-powered remote desktop and browser automation system that allows users to control their computer remotely using Telegram commands.

---

# Features 🚀

- Remote desktop control
- Browser automation
- Telegram AI assistant
- Open folders remotely
- Download files from PC
- YouTube automation
- Google search automation
- AI-powered workflows
- Local AI support (Ollama / Phi3)

---

# Tech Stack 🛠

- Python
- Telegram Bot API
- Playwright
- Ollama
- Phi3
- dotenv

---

# Installation ⚡

## 1. Clone Repository

```bash
git clone https://github.com/YOUR_USERNAME/open-air.git
cd open-air
```

---

## 2. Create Virtual Environment

```bash
python -m venv .venv
```

---

## 3. Activate Virtual Environment

### Windows

```bash
.venv\Scripts\activate.bat
```

---

## 4. Install Requirements

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

---

# Telegram Bot Setup 🤖

## 1. Open Telegram

Search:

```txt
@BotFather
```

---

## 2. Create New Bot

Send:

```txt
/newbot
```

Then:

- Enter bot name
- Enter bot username

BotFather will give:

```txt
BOT TOKEN
```

---

# 3. Get Telegram Chat ID 🔑

## Method 1 — Direct URL 😎

Open this URL in browser:

```txt
https://api.telegram.org/botYOUR_BOT_TOKEN/getUpdates
```

Replace:

```txt
YOUR_BOT_TOKEN
```

with your real bot token.

---

# Example 🔥

```txt
https://api.telegram.org/bot123456:ABCXYZ/getUpdates
```

---

# IMPORTANT ⚠️

Before opening URL:

1. Open your bot in Telegram
2. Send:

```txt
hi
```

to your bot.

Then open URL 😈

---

# OUTPUT 😎

You will see:

```json
{
  "ok": true,
  "result": [
    {
      "message": {
        "chat": {
          "id": 123456789
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
```

---

# COPY THIS 😈

```txt
123456789
```

That is your:

```txt
CHAT_ID
```

---

# Add To `.env` 🔥

```env
WEB_BOT_TOKEN=your_browser_bot_token
FILE_BOT_TOKEN=your_file_manager_bot_token
CHAT_ID=123456789
```

# Environment Variables 🔐

Create:

```txt
.env
```

Inside project folder.

Add:

```env
WEB_BOT_TOKEN=your_browser_bot_token
FILE_BOT_TOKEN=your_file_manager_bot_token
CHAT_ID=your_chat_id
```

---

# Run Browser AI Agent 🌐

```bash
python telegram_agent.py
```

---

# Run File Manager Agent 📂

```bash
python telegram_file_manager.py
```

