---

# Security ⚠️

Never upload:

- `.env`
- Bot Tokens
- API Keys

Create:

```txt
.gitignore
```

Add:

```txt
.env
.venv/
venv/
__pycache__/
```

---

# Vision 🌍

Open Air aims to become an AI-powered remote operating system capable of controlling browsers, desktops, workflows, and applications using natural language commands.

